<title>PHILIPPINES: BPI shares to be suspended from Oct 25.</title>
<headline>BPI shares to be suspended from Oct 25.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in Bank of the Philippine Islands shares at the Philippine Stock Exchange are to be suspended from October 25 to November 4 in view of the bank's planned secondary offering, a notice from the exchange said on Friday.</p>
<p>The suspension was approved by the exchange's board of governors upon the request of BPI, it said.</p>
</text>
